<div class="wrap">

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">✨ Pricing</div>
    <h1>Simple, category-based pricing</h1>
    <p>How much you pay depends on what you're listing — a house for sale, a room to rent, or a BNB you'll keep live all year. No agent commission, ever.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="plans-trust">
    <div class="plans-trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>No agents, ever</div>
    <div class="plans-trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="2" y1="10" x2="22" y2="10"/></svg>Pay via M-Pesa</div>
    <div class="plans-trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>Cancel any time</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ ONE-TIME LISTING FEES ═══ -->
  <div class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="kicker">Sale &amp; rent listings</div>
      <h2>One-time listing fee, live until it's sold or occupied</h2>
      <p>Pay once when your listing is approved. Sale listings stay live until you mark them sold — no expiry countdown. Rental listings stay live until you mark them occupied.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fee-table-card">
      <table class="fee-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>How it's priced</th><th>Example</th><th>Fee</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="fee-table-body">
          <tr><td colspan="4" style="text-align:center;color:var(--text-3);padding:30px">Loading current pricing…</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="fee-footnote" id="fee-footnote">Fees are a small percentage of your listing price, with a floor and ceiling so cheap listings stay affordable and high-value listings still reflect the property's worth. Compare this to a typical agent commission of 2–5% on a sale, or a month's rent to place a tenant.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ BNB / AIRBNB SUBSCRIPTION ═══ -->
  <div class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="kicker">Airbnb &amp; short-stay hosts</div>
      <h2>BNB plans — one flat monthly fee</h2>
      <p>Unlike a sale or a rental, your BNB is a business you run continuously — so instead of a one-time fee, it's a small monthly subscription that keeps your listing(s) live and bookable.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bnb-plans" id="bnb-plans-grid">
      <div class="bnb-card">
        <h3>BNB Basic</h3>
        <p class="bnb-desc">For hosts with a single unit.</p>
        <div class="bnb-price"><span id="bnb-basic-price">KES —</span><span>/month</span></div>
        <div class="bnb-price-note">1 active listing</div>
        <a href="#" class="bnb-cta" onclick="startSubscriptionCheckout('bnb_basic');return false">Get Basic</a>
        <ul class="bnb-feats">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>1 BNB listing stays live all month</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Buyers message you directly</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Cancel any time</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bnb-card reco">
        <div class="bnb-ribbon">Most hosts pick this</div>
        <h3>BNB Bundle</h3>
        <p class="bnb-desc">For hosts with a few units under one roof or portfolio.</p>
        <div class="bnb-price"><span id="bnb-bundle-price">KES —</span><span>/month</span></div>
        <div class="bnb-price-note">Up to 5 active listings</div>
        <a href="#" class="bnb-cta" onclick="startSubscriptionCheckout('bnb_bundle');return false">Get Bundle</a>
        <ul class="bnb-feats">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Up to 5 BNB listings live at once</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Cheaper per unit than Basic</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Cancel any time</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bnb-card">
        <h3>BNB Unlimited</h3>
        <p class="bnb-desc">For agencies and hosts managing 6+ units.</p>
        <div class="bnb-price"><span id="bnb-unlimited-price">KES —</span><span>/month</span></div>
        <div class="bnb-price-note">Unlimited active listings</div>
        <a href="#" class="bnb-cta" onclick="startSubscriptionCheckout('bnb_unlimited');return false">Get Unlimited</a>
        <ul class="bnb-feats">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>No cap on how many BNB listings you run</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Best value once you pass 6 units</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Cancel any time</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ SELLER TOOL PLANS (Free / Premium / Elite) ═══ -->
  <div class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="kicker">Seller tools</div>
      <h2>Add-on plans for active sellers &amp; landlords</h2>
      <p>These sit on top of your listing fees — for sellers who want managed chat, market insights, or unlimited listings for a rental portfolio.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="billing-toggle">
      <span class="bt-label active" id="label-monthly">Monthly</span>
      <button class="bt-switch" id="billing-switch" onclick="toggleBilling()" aria-label="Toggle yearly billing" aria-pressed="false"></button>
      <span class="bt-label" id="label-yearly">Yearly</span>
      <span class="bt-save">Save ~17%</span>
    </div>

    <div class="plans" id="plans-grid">
      <div class="plan free">
